<PARA INFOID = "T030063A100" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "11Sep2003"     INFOTYPE = "PARTS" INDSW = "ON">
<TITLE>Gear Train</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>The torque converter and oil pump are located on the input shaft, and a planetary gear is used as the forward/reverse switching mechanism.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>It consists of a continuously variable transmission mechanism made up of 1 pair of pulleys and a metal belt, a reduction gear pair, a final gear pair and a differential mechanism. Shifting is performed steplessly by varying the winding diameter of the metal belt on the pulleys, whose groove width is varied by hydraulic pressure.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
